# MOOLA Mobile — Environment Variables
# Copy to .env.local for local overrides.
# NOTE: By default, you do NOT need to set EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL in local development!
# The app automatically discovers:
#   - Laptop browser (Chrome): uses window.location.hostname
#   - Android Phone (Expo Go): uses Metro bundler host IP
#   - Android Emulator: uses 10.0.2.2
#
# Only set this if using an explicit ngrok / cloudflared tunnel or targeting production.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://xxxx.ngrok-free.app/api/v1
